          ],
          "text": "The United States argues that more than 11\u202fmillion removable non\u2011citizens exist, DHS has limited resources, and enforcement priorities are necessary; the district court\u2019s sweeping vacatur of the guidelines should be reversed."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "United States",
